<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamist militants in Nigeria killed 24 Christians in an overnight attack and expanded Lakurawa bases into South Kebbi, while Fulanis killed and kidnapped Christians in Kaduna State. Russian forces retook Kidal and Mali announced a recapture of the city without fighting, showing renewed external military involvement. Niger expelled French intelligence agents, increasing diplomatic tension in the region. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPY0xJcFB4WlYzNTBybzNPUlJKWGtEbTdHc2gzdnNhQXNNblFZT2RMakNVZmpKVWNHSTFGaW9HZFF6eHFLZHdsXzlTaWM2cHoxSXdLemttMUFIYVZHbllEQmI5ZXUybTU2VFI4WTRWOEZSRkk5M0M0aEtQYk5zc3Z1WF9Cb0JDNV9ZcERqd29HVWtwWENNTTY4eU53?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Chronicle PH&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTFBjaGtsUlNBRkpjaHZhYmxEbzE2MzViRXB6TWs4RnBfVDJzQXl6OU1LdTNBOGE1NzBaMUZyNlh5OGk5TEZNRDZsdWk0RUdRcEQyUVFGcGg0aUo1cGtieFVSSzdTWGM4LWVoTktGQ0lnNFA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Voice of Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxNMWY5bEVmR0ZCdFVMTExoWXctTWlQR1paUlgxUDNKeVIxcmt2bzMtMWJ1R1Y0LWNIRTYtUkxDazRINjZGcTRLQmxTeDRKbFFpMnVhS2RzSGctajI4QWY4YmJrSDQ3cEFXOEd0YmFKckNsTGRranJWbDk3SkVyUHBVbXAxX1gtTnZXX2J4U1duTmUwWFJXSng0ZkRZeXpiV3Ywd1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOdVlyQnZSWjNpeHdLSTd6YlFHWm9VeDF2Q2pjaVhuam9kaVczdkwyUDY4RlA0VjhVaWJFREh4Q1I1RVFoNGZfZ2ZUVHFiMXE5aDFjamZzdkxoNW9rUjYzQ3dNWllfR0sta2pEZmxLTXNQbDFVT1h2bTM5QmllSmhjNmxzT3pPQXZ3VjI4cVQ2dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNWnZFS0EyUkk0TUZPcm5Qd0pNNWdUcUxRb1p1QTEySjl6cEI3dTZVNVUtR2F3cFpXaXdtbGN6bncxdElDTjNCSDhuMXpKWDRVY043RHR4MF